Thinking back now,

590
00:27:52,549 --> 00:27:54,030
I was so foolish back then.

591
00:27:54,629 --> 00:27:55,829
Although it wasn't doing well,

592
00:27:56,829 --> 00:27:57,829
it was nowhere near

593
00:27:58,309 --> 00:27:59,510
having to file for bankruptcy.

594
00:28:00,829 --> 00:28:01,750
Where is the money?

595
00:28:02,549 --> 00:28:03,109
Anything left?

596
00:28:03,349 --> 00:28:04,430
He said it all went

597
00:28:05,309 --> 00:28:06,270
to debts and payroll.

598
00:28:08,190 --> 00:28:08,629
Ms. Hui,

599
00:28:09,829 --> 00:28:10,710
don't you think

600
00:28:11,470 --> 00:28:12,990
he was preying on your family?

601
00:28:13,510 --> 00:28:14,069
Look.

602
00:28:14,710 --> 00:28:15,589
After your dad died,

603
00:28:15,910 --> 00:28:17,349
he moved in on you,

604
00:28:17,829 --> 00:28:18,589
exploited your lack

605
00:28:18,589 --> 00:28:19,230
of experience,

606
00:28:19,510 --> 00:28:20,510
and sold your factory.

607
00:28:21,270 --> 00:28:22,389
So I reasonably suspect

608
00:28:22,549 --> 00:28:23,270
that before me,

609
00:28:23,750 --> 00:28:24,950
the first family he preyed on

610
00:28:25,190 --> 00:28:25,990
was yours.

611
00:28:26,349 --> 00:28:27,789
I thought he was saving me.

612
00:28:28,869 --> 00:28:30,510
Turns out he was dragging me down.

613
00:28:32,589 --> 00:28:34,109
Instead of saving me,

614
00:28:35,230 --> 00:28:36,549
he cast me into an abyss.

615
00:28:37,910 --> 00:28:39,149
If Di Liren is truly guilty,

616
00:28:40,510 --> 00:28:41,789
I will make sure

617
00:28:41,990 --> 00:28:42,750
he pays the price.

618
00:28:45,309 --> 00:28:45,750
By the way,

619
00:28:46,750 --> 00:28:47,549
I just had an idea

620
00:28:48,389 --> 00:28:49,349
about Peng Cheng.

621
00:28:50,589 --> 00:28:51,470
I'll look into it.

622
00:28:52,990 --> 00:28:54,629
Contact me anytime if anything comes up.

623
00:28:56,109 --> 00:28:56,710
Call Jiao Xu

624
00:28:57,109 --> 00:28:57,869
or Liu Zi.

625
00:28:58,270 --> 00:28:58,869
What is this?

626
00:28:59,869 --> 00:29:00,470
Concern?

627
00:29:02,109 --> 00:29:03,910
Call it whatever you want.

628
00:29:04,629 --> 00:29:05,750
I never imagined

629
00:29:06,309 --> 00:29:07,069
our relationship

630
00:29:07,190 --> 00:29:08,309
would end up like this.

631
00:29:10,309 --> 00:29:11,109
Neither did I.

632
00:29:12,869 --> 00:29:13,869
Fate dealt us

633
00:29:14,069 --> 00:29:15,030
the exact same hand.

634
00:29:15,230 --> 00:29:16,695
We were preyed upon by the same man.

635
00:29:16,990 --> 00:29:17,829
You could call it

636
00:29:18,069 --> 00:29:19,030
a strange kind of fate.

637
00:29:19,349 --> 00:29:20,829
I just hope there won't be

638
00:29:20,829 --> 00:29:22,030
a next victim.

639
00:29:26,990 --> 00:29:27,549
Stay safe.

640
00:29:34,910 --> 00:29:36,309
I've told you many times.

641
00:29:37,030 --> 00:29:37,670
I really...

642
00:29:39,109 --> 00:29:39,829
See for yourself!

643
00:29:40,910 --> 00:29:41,869
My pockets are empty!

644
00:29:41,869 --> 00:29:42,349
Oh, right.

645
00:29:43,510 --> 00:29:44,030
Look.

646
00:29:44,030 --> 00:29:45,030
Search my pockets.

647
00:29:45,230 --> 00:29:46,430
Come on. Check them yourself.

648
00:29:49,030 --> 00:29:49,869
Let me tell you.

649
00:29:51,109 --> 00:29:52,829
If that money isn't in my account soon,

650
00:29:53,950 --> 00:29:55,149
I'll go straight to Lu Hui.

651
00:29:56,389 --> 00:29:56,990
Think about it.

652
00:29:58,470 --> 00:29:59,309
The money is ready.

653
00:30:00,990 --> 00:30:01,518
Just say it?

654
00:30:02,950 --> 00:30:04,051
Zhang Tao will transfer it.

655
00:30:04,349 --> 00:30:05,230
That's more like it!

656
00:30:05,309 --> 00:30:06,549
That's what friends are for,

657
00:30:06,589 --> 00:30:07,030
right?

658
00:30:08,750 --> 00:30:09,190
But...

659
00:30:09,389 --> 00:30:10,030
You.

660
00:30:10,230 --> 00:30:11,670
You've fooled me

661
00:30:11,750 --> 00:30:12,670
so many times before.

662
00:30:12,789 --> 00:30:13,629
You have to give me

663
00:30:13,670 --> 00:30:14,750
an exact transfer time.

664
00:30:18,190 --> 00:30:18,910
3 PM,

665
00:30:19,629 --> 00:30:20,109
Wednesday.

666
00:30:20,589 --> 00:30:21,510
If it's a minute late,

667
00:30:22,389 --> 00:30:24,069
I'll tell Lu Hui everything

668
00:30:24,470 --> 00:30:25,270
from that day.

669
00:30:27,549 --> 00:30:28,190
Don't worry.

670
00:30:28,950 --> 00:30:29,710
It will be there.

671
00:30:34,430 --> 00:30:35,629
Look at you now.

672
00:30:36,030 --> 00:30:36,829
After the divorce,

673
00:30:36,829 --> 00:30:38,069
you don't even dress properly.

674
00:30:38,470 --> 00:30:39,030
Go away!

675
00:30:39,869 --> 00:30:40,349
What?

676
00:30:40,629 --> 00:30:41,750
I helped you with it before!

677
00:30:41,829 --> 00:30:42,270
Get lost!

678
00:30:43,798 --> 00:30:45,109
Trying to scare me?

679
00:30:47,589 --> 00:30:48,589
Seriously,

680
00:30:49,789 --> 00:30:51,030
always hoarding the good stuff.

681
00:30:51,589 --> 00:30:52,270
Let me tell you.

682
00:30:52,750 --> 00:30:53,670
If it's a minute late,

683
00:30:54,549 --> 00:30:55,230
I'll find Lu Hui.

684
00:30:56,910 --> 00:30:57,389
Got it?

685
00:30:58,629 --> 00:30:59,510
Don't forget!

686
00:31:09,117 --> 00:31:09,672
One Bamboo.

687
00:31:10,510 --> 00:31:10,869
I win!

688
00:31:13,869 --> 00:31:14,470
I'm done.

689
00:31:14,629 --> 00:31:16,149
My hand's absolute garbage.

690
00:31:16,710 --> 00:31:17,750
You've smelled garbage?

691
00:31:19,470 --> 00:31:20,389
Here, take it all.

692
00:31:20,589 --> 00:31:21,190
No more.

693
00:31:21,629 --> 00:31:21,990
Okay.

694
00:31:21,990 --> 00:31:22,470
I'm done.

695
00:31:24,346 --> 00:31:24,950
Let's call it.

696
00:31:24,950 --> 00:31:26,024
Might as well get a drink.

697
00:31:42,270 --> 00:31:42,629
You...

698
00:31:43,109 --> 00:31:43,549
Why...

699
00:31:44,030 --> 00:31:45,670
Why are you looking for me again?

700
00:31:46,629 --> 00:31:48,230
I want to know what happened

701
00:31:49,349 --> 00:31:50,549
the day my dad died.

702
00:31:51,030 --> 00:31:51,750
Who's your dad?

703
00:31:52,510 --> 00:31:53,716
I don't even know who you are,

704
00:31:53,716 --> 00:31:54,430
and you're asking me about your dad?

705
00:31:54,430 --> 00:31:55,149
Are you for real?

706
00:31:55,589 --> 00:31:56,629
My dad was Lu Zhiming.

707
00:31:57,389 --> 00:31:58,309
I know you know me,

708
00:31:59,589 --> 00:32:00,389
and you've been

709
00:32:00,389 --> 00:32:01,549
asking Di Liren for money.

710
00:32:03,710 --> 00:32:04,230
So, let's

711
00:32:04,230 --> 00:32:05,670
lay all our cards on the table.

712
00:32:06,670 --> 00:32:07,910
As long as you tell me

713
00:32:08,629 --> 00:32:09,430
what really happened

714
00:32:10,230 --> 00:32:10,910
the day

715
00:32:10,910 --> 00:32:11,990
my dad had the accident,

716
00:32:13,109 --> 00:32:14,270
whatever Di Liren

717
00:32:14,309 --> 00:32:15,109
promised you,

718
00:32:16,990 --> 00:32:18,470
I will

719
00:32:20,470 --> 00:32:21,270
top it.

720
00:32:42,750 --> 00:32:43,510
Sorry,

721
00:32:44,670 --> 00:32:45,270
I don't know

722
00:32:45,349 --> 00:32:46,170
what you're saying.

723
00:32:46,710 --> 00:32:47,789
As for asking for money,

724
00:32:47,869 --> 00:32:49,349
you might have got the wrong idea.

725
00:32:50,270 --> 00:32:50,990
Who am I?

726
00:32:51,589 --> 00:32:52,149
I'm just...

727
00:32:55,309 --> 00:32:56,629
Mr. Di is a big boss.

728
00:32:56,710 --> 00:32:57,670
How would I dare?

729
00:32:58,190 --> 00:32:59,109
I was just

730
00:32:59,149 --> 00:32:59,869
borrowing money

731
00:32:59,950 --> 00:33:00,950
as an old friend.

732
00:33:08,510 --> 00:33:09,629
Don't come again.

733
00:33:10,069 --> 00:33:10,910
Ask all you want.

734
00:33:11,230 --> 00:33:12,030
I'm not budging.

735
00:33:13,629 --> 00:33:14,109
I'm leaving.

736
00:33:23,688 --> 00:33:29,640
(Mahjong Parlor)

737
00:33:35,430 --> 00:33:36,190
Who are you?

738
00:33:36,549 --> 00:33:36,910
Get in!

739
00:33:37,270 --> 00:33:38,389
Easy. Easy!

740
00:33:38,629 --> 00:33:39,069
Easy!

741
00:33:39,629 --> 00:33:41,030
What do you want?

742
00:33:43,510 --> 00:33:43,990
Don't move.

743
00:33:44,789 --> 00:33:45,349
Di Liren...

744
00:33:46,910 --> 00:33:48,230
Why did Mr. Di send you here?

745
00:33:50,670 --> 00:33:51,750
I sent him here.

746
00:34:01,549 --> 00:34:02,230
You...

747
00:34:04,309 --> 00:34:05,109
What are you doing

748
00:34:05,109 --> 00:34:06,109
in the dark?

749
00:34:06,629 --> 00:34:07,869
I have told you many times.

750
00:34:08,229 --> 00:34:09,229
I don't know anything!

751
00:34:09,269 --> 00:34:10,189
Di Liren and I

752
00:34:10,390 --> 00:34:11,390
aren't even that close.

753
00:34:11,669 --> 00:34:12,549
Why won't you

754
00:34:12,549 --> 00:34:13,350
just listen?

755
00:34:14,069 --> 00:34:14,870
I'm telling you.

756
00:34:15,189 --> 00:34:15,950
If you keep it up,

757
00:34:15,950 --> 00:34:16,749
I'll call the cops!

758
00:34:17,589 --> 00:34:19,109
Relax, we're just talking.

759
00:34:19,510 --> 00:34:20,269
If you're worried,

760
00:34:20,269 --> 00:34:21,189
I can drive us right up

761
00:34:21,229 --> 00:34:21,830
to the police.

762
00:34:22,030 --> 00:34:23,629
Yeah, don't be so nervous.

763
00:34:24,149 --> 00:34:25,189
We just have a recording

764
00:34:25,310 --> 00:34:26,350
about you.

765
00:34:26,549 --> 00:34:27,430
We want you to listen.

766
00:34:28,109 --> 00:34:28,910
What recording?

767
00:34:29,443 --> 00:34:30,589
A recording of me singing,

768
00:34:30,589 --> 00:34:31,749
or cussing someone out?

769
00:34:36,936 --> 00:34:38,749
(Recording)

770
00:34:38,749 --> 00:34:39,430
(Every time)

771
00:34:39,430 --> 00:34:40,558
(you wire Peng Cheng money,)

772
00:34:40,749 --> 00:34:41,589
(you must record it.)

773
00:34:42,310 --> 00:34:43,669
(Watch what you say to him, too.)

774
00:34:43,830 --> 00:34:45,229
(Subtly steer the conversation)

775
00:34:45,269 --> 00:34:46,310
(toward extortion.)

776
00:34:50,470 --> 00:34:50,990
Well?

777
00:34:51,589 --> 00:34:52,269
Di Liren's voice

778
00:34:52,310 --> 00:34:53,229
sounds familiar, huh?

779
00:34:53,549 --> 00:34:55,069
Every time you asked him for money,

780
00:34:55,189 --> 00:34:56,030
he recorded it.

781
00:34:56,430 --> 00:34:57,149
Because he'll use

782
00:34:57,189 --> 00:34:58,549
extortion charges

783
00:34:59,149 --> 00:35:00,229
to put you behind bars.

784
00:35:01,990 --> 00:35:03,510
Didn't he promise you

785
00:35:03,950 --> 00:35:05,069
he'd transfer the money

786
00:35:05,310 --> 00:35:06,350
by 3 PM this Wednesday?

787
00:35:07,950 --> 00:35:08,589
He really

788
00:35:08,749 --> 00:35:10,310
is having Zhang Tao send you the money.

789
00:35:10,669 --> 00:35:12,629
But the second you take it,

790
00:35:13,830 --> 00:35:14,709
your prison sentence

791
00:35:15,229 --> 00:35:16,390
will be sealed.

792
00:35:19,669 --> 00:35:20,589
That shameless fool!

793
00:35:23,430 --> 00:35:24,430
Tomorrow is Wednesday.

794
00:35:24,890 --> 00:35:26,269
The money hasn't been transferred,

795
00:35:26,830 --> 00:35:27,390
which means

796
00:35:28,310 --> 00:35:29,350
you still have a chance.

797
00:35:30,310 --> 00:35:30,907
Meaning what?

798
00:35:32,990 --> 00:35:34,229
Zhang Tao might not send it,

799
00:35:34,910 --> 00:35:35,990
provided that

800
00:35:35,990 --> 00:35:37,310
you explain every detail

801
00:35:37,310 --> 00:35:38,510
of my dad's car crash.

802
00:35:39,310 --> 00:35:40,030
Come clean,

803
00:35:40,549 --> 00:35:41,709
and my previous offer

804
00:35:41,749 --> 00:35:42,510
still stands.

805
00:35:43,510 --> 00:35:44,189
Keep quiet,

806
00:35:44,709 --> 00:35:46,189
and the amount Di Liren sends

807
00:35:46,749 --> 00:35:47,950
is enough to keep you

808
00:35:48,189 --> 00:35:49,030
behind bars

809
00:35:49,069 --> 00:35:49,910
forever.

810
00:35:50,350 --> 00:35:51,310
The outside world,

811
00:35:51,830 --> 00:35:52,589
mahjong parlors,

812
00:35:52,990 --> 00:35:53,790
and nightlife,

813
00:35:55,149 --> 00:35:56,470
will have nothing to do with you.

814
00:35:58,629 --> 00:35:59,830
No time for you to think.

815
00:36:00,950 --> 00:36:01,950
Large wire transfers

816
00:36:01,990 --> 00:36:03,030
need advance scheduling.

817
00:36:03,669 --> 00:36:04,870
Zhang Tao is handling it soon.

818
00:36:05,235 --> 00:36:05,790
I'll give you

819
00:36:05,790 --> 00:36:07,030
one last three-count.

820
00:36:07,990 --> 00:36:08,430
Three,

821
00:36:10,950 --> 00:36:11,430
two...

822
00:36:15,950 --> 00:36:16,430
I'll talk!

823
00:36:20,262 --> 00:36:21,430
When your dad had his crash,

824
00:36:22,790 --> 00:36:24,549
Di Liren approached me

825
00:36:24,549 --> 00:36:25,350
first.

826
00:36:28,109 --> 00:36:28,910
He came to me.

827
00:36:29,709 --> 00:36:30,470
Our company

828
00:36:30,470 --> 00:36:31,350
was drowning in debt.

829
00:36:32,390 --> 00:36:34,109
We only wanted

830
00:36:34,269 --> 00:36:35,069
to corner him

831
00:36:35,109 --> 00:36:36,310
and get him to sign an IOU.

832
00:36:36,390 --> 00:36:37,990
We never expected it to blow up.

833
00:36:52,629 --> 00:36:54,269
Didn't I say I'd send you the money?

834
00:36:56,430 --> 00:36:56,870
Yeah,

835
00:36:57,229 --> 00:36:59,189
and once I take your cash,

836
00:36:59,870 --> 00:37:01,189
you'll call the cops

837
00:37:01,669 --> 00:37:02,790
and report me for extortion.

838
00:37:04,830 --> 00:37:05,910
How could I do that?

839
00:37:06,629 --> 00:37:07,149
I wouldn't.

840
00:37:11,350 --> 00:37:11,870
Did someone

841
00:37:11,950 --> 00:37:12,669
tip you off?

842
00:37:13,030 --> 00:37:14,350
Does anyone need to tip me off?

843
00:37:14,870 --> 00:37:16,189
We've been friends for decades.

844
00:37:16,189 --> 00:37:17,109
You think I don't know

845
00:37:17,149 --> 00:37:18,229
the tricks you're pulling?

846
00:37:19,830 --> 00:37:20,629
What's that saying?

847
00:37:20,629 --> 00:37:21,870
Take a shower with a raincoat.

848
00:37:21,870 --> 00:37:22,510
Now, you're just

849
00:37:22,510 --> 00:37:23,629
moonwalking naked

850
00:37:23,709 --> 00:37:24,749
in broad daylight.

851
00:37:26,390 --> 00:37:27,589
Isn't that the truth?

852
00:37:27,988 --> 00:37:29,430
Believe it or not, it's up to you.

853
00:37:29,709 --> 00:37:30,350
Get lost.

854
00:37:32,549 --> 00:37:33,269
If you think

855
00:37:33,390 --> 00:37:34,669
I'll trap you with a transfer,

856
00:37:35,350 --> 00:37:36,390
do you still want it?

857
00:37:36,549 --> 00:37:37,269
Of course,

858
00:37:39,229 --> 00:37:39,629
I want it.

859
00:37:41,390 --> 00:37:41,910
Triple.

860
00:37:43,830 --> 00:37:44,430
Triple?

861
00:37:45,069 --> 00:37:45,629
Triple.

862
00:37:48,549 --> 00:37:49,229
Based on what?

863
00:37:50,189 --> 00:37:51,069
You're pulling

864
00:37:51,189 --> 00:37:51,870
a fake extortion

865
00:37:52,174 --> 00:37:53,109
to jack up the price.

866
00:37:59,749 --> 00:38:00,350
Based on this.

867
00:38:03,816 --> 00:38:04,712
(IOU: Received 100,000 yuan
from Lu Zhiming)

868
00:38:04,712 --> 00:38:05,544
(Term: 7 days, due on October 5, 2004)

869
00:38:05,544 --> 00:38:06,344
(Borrower assumes full legal liability
if payment is overdue)

870
00:38:06,344 --> 00:38:07,222
(Borrower: Fang Yong)

871
00:38:13,910 --> 00:38:14,629
Be careful.

872
00:38:25,669 --> 00:38:26,629
How do you have this?

873
00:38:27,310 --> 00:38:27,910
I already...

874
00:38:27,950 --> 00:38:28,390
Burned it,

875
00:38:28,990 --> 00:38:29,350
right?

876
00:38:30,709 --> 00:38:32,229
The one burned back then was fake.

877
00:38:33,189 --> 00:38:34,549
I swapped it out long ago.

878
00:38:34,790 --> 00:38:36,030
You think all my years

879
00:38:36,149 --> 00:38:36,749
in casinos

880
00:38:36,790 --> 00:38:37,749
were for nothing?

881
00:38:38,149 --> 00:38:39,430
I pulled a switcheroo

882
00:38:39,669 --> 00:38:40,390
on that thing.

883
00:38:40,549 --> 00:38:41,790
The real one was long gone.

884
00:38:41,870 --> 00:38:43,109
You never even noticed.

885
00:38:49,470 --> 00:38:50,870
You keep calling me your friend,

886
00:38:51,709 --> 00:38:53,030
but never treated me like one.

887
00:38:53,189 --> 00:38:54,390
Let's not point fingers.

888
00:38:54,950 --> 00:38:55,669
We're even.

889
00:38:57,629 --> 00:38:59,030
If I hadn't covered my own back,

890
00:38:59,269 --> 00:39:00,069
I'd be sitting

891
00:39:00,149 --> 00:39:00,950
in a cell now.

892
00:39:09,109 --> 00:39:10,709
Having this won't help you anyway.

893
00:39:12,669 --> 00:39:13,589
What does it prove?

894
00:39:15,669 --> 00:39:16,709
Listen up, then.

895
00:39:17,350 --> 00:39:18,749
At the very least, it proves

896
00:39:19,629 --> 00:39:20,950
that you and Lu Zhiming

897
00:39:21,430 --> 00:39:22,350
had financial disputes.

898
00:39:22,870 --> 00:39:23,629
I can also prove

899
00:39:23,790 --> 00:39:24,749
that you're tied

900
00:39:24,910 --> 00:39:25,749
to that car crash.

901
00:39:26,350 --> 00:39:27,229
Don't you dare forget

902
00:39:27,669 --> 00:39:28,310
that everything

903
00:39:28,470 --> 00:39:29,470
started because of you.

904
00:39:29,629 --> 00:39:31,269
You were the root cause

905
00:39:31,669 --> 00:39:32,390
and the trigger.

906
00:39:32,950 --> 00:39:33,830
Not a threat,

907
00:39:34,430 --> 00:39:35,269
but if this case

908
00:39:35,350 --> 00:39:36,510
ever gets reopened,

909
00:39:36,669 --> 00:39:39,069
I'm pinning the whole thing on you

910
00:39:39,709 --> 00:39:40,430
as the mastermind.

911
00:39:42,749 --> 00:39:44,069
I don't know what you're saying.

912
00:39:44,189 --> 00:39:44,749
Yeah, right.

913
00:39:44,749 --> 00:39:45,669
Play dumb all you want.

914
00:39:46,269 --> 00:39:47,030
No problem.

915
00:39:47,589 --> 00:39:48,950
I'm just laying out

916
00:39:48,990 --> 00:39:49,669
the pros and cons

917
00:39:49,669 --> 00:39:50,910
of this whole thing for you,

918
00:39:51,430 --> 00:39:52,109
to see if the gig

919
00:39:52,149 --> 00:39:52,790
is worth it.

920
00:39:53,470 --> 00:39:54,790
If you don't want it,

921
00:39:54,790 --> 00:39:55,950
I'll just go to Lu Hui.

922
00:39:57,030 --> 00:39:57,790
When that happens,

923
00:39:57,790 --> 00:39:58,629
I'll dump everything

924
00:39:58,629 --> 00:39:59,510
right on you.

925
00:39:59,830 --> 00:40:01,510
I'll take the money and disappear,

926
00:40:02,310 --> 00:40:03,149
but you

927
00:40:04,149 --> 00:40:05,149
will have nowhere to run.

928
00:40:07,069 --> 00:40:07,749
A bit sudden,

929
00:40:08,310 --> 00:40:08,830
isn't it?

930
00:40:09,390 --> 00:40:10,390
I suggest you reconsider.

931
00:40:10,709 --> 00:40:11,149
Reconsider.

932
00:40:18,069 --> 00:40:19,269
The same card as before?

933
00:40:19,990 --> 00:40:20,510
Cash.

934
00:40:24,749 --> 00:40:26,030
This time, I want cash.

935
00:40:33,749 --> 00:40:34,950
(He agreed to pay triple)

936
00:40:34,950 --> 00:40:35,543
(for the IOU.)

937
00:40:35,990 --> 00:40:37,030
(Once he gets it ready,)

938
00:40:37,350 --> 00:40:38,069
(he'll text me)

939
00:40:38,189 --> 00:40:39,229
(the time and location.)

940
00:40:39,476 --> 00:40:40,189
(I'll forward it)

941
00:40:40,189 --> 00:40:40,910
(right away.)

942
00:40:44,310 --> 00:40:45,629
Maybe I'm just being paranoid,

943
00:40:46,669 --> 00:40:48,310
but if Peng Cheng could betray Di Liren,

944
00:40:48,870 --> 00:40:49,870
could Di Liren

945
00:40:50,030 --> 00:40:50,790
talk him back over

946
00:40:51,149 --> 00:40:51,749
and have him

947
00:40:52,269 --> 00:40:53,069
turn on us again?

948
00:40:54,470 --> 00:40:54,990
No.

949
00:40:55,709 --> 00:40:56,549
Since he brought up

950
00:40:56,589 --> 00:40:57,430
the IOU,

951
00:40:57,629 --> 00:40:58,870
it means he's determined

952
00:40:58,870 --> 00:41:00,149
to sever ties with Di Liren.

953
00:41:02,589 --> 00:41:03,629
Right now,

954
00:41:04,030 --> 00:41:05,430
we have the IOU as proof,

955
00:41:06,109 --> 00:41:07,510
but Di Liren is too shrewd.

956
00:41:07,830 --> 00:41:09,350
To avoid leaving evidence on tape,

957
00:41:09,910 --> 00:41:10,870
once he hears anything

958
00:41:11,430 --> 00:41:13,390
about my dad's crash,

959
00:41:14,229 --> 00:41:15,390
he denies all involvement

960
00:41:16,149 --> 00:41:17,669
and distances himself completely.

961
00:41:20,629 --> 00:41:21,910
So we must use

962
00:41:21,990 --> 00:41:22,749
this IOU

963
00:41:23,149 --> 00:41:23,990
to draw Di Liren out,

964
00:41:24,390 --> 00:41:25,870
catch him red-handed,

965
00:41:26,430 --> 00:41:27,589
and prove his guilt.

966
00:41:29,749 --> 00:41:30,589
Guilt is a disease.

967
00:41:31,870 --> 00:41:33,109
I'll make sure he gets cured.

968
00:41:39,950 --> 00:41:40,470
For you.

969
00:41:41,510 --> 00:41:42,229
I remember this is

970
00:41:42,229 --> 00:41:43,149
your usual perfume.

971
00:41:45,069 --> 00:41:46,109
Wearing perfume as a maid

972
00:41:46,269 --> 00:41:47,629
often gets complaints.

973
00:41:48,350 --> 00:41:49,341
Quit using it ages ago.

974
00:41:50,078 --> 00:41:50,944
Don't even like it.

975
00:41:52,069 --> 00:41:53,549
Now I'm more used to the smell

976
00:41:53,549 --> 00:41:54,830
of disinfectant and hand soap.

977
00:41:55,990 --> 00:41:56,982
You love staying clean.

978
00:41:57,310 --> 00:41:58,149
Always been fresh.

979
00:41:58,910 --> 00:41:59,470
You don't need

980
00:41:59,470 --> 00:42:00,510
these fancy scents anyway.

981
00:42:00,990 --> 00:42:01,549
Just use it

982
00:42:02,189 --> 00:42:03,350
as an air freshener.

983
00:42:05,709 --> 00:42:06,229
Honey,

984
00:42:08,069 --> 00:42:08,510
the company

985
00:42:08,510 --> 00:42:09,549
just landed a big project,

986
00:42:10,310 --> 00:42:11,790
so cash flow is a bit tight.

987
00:42:12,669 --> 00:42:13,669
I'll have to funnel

988
00:42:13,790 --> 00:42:14,430
all my income

989
00:42:14,430 --> 00:42:15,514
into the company for now.

990
00:42:17,830 --> 00:42:18,790
What kind of project?

991
00:42:19,990 --> 00:42:20,669
Well...

992
00:42:25,288 --> 00:42:26,888
(Beloved Father, Lu Zhiming
Beloved Mother, Wang Xiuzhi)

993
00:42:34,600 --> 00:42:37,224
=The Vanishing Beauty=
(Next Episode Preview)

994
00:42:37,669 --> 00:42:38,189
Oh, no.

995
00:42:38,870 --> 00:42:40,189
Di Liren beat us to it again.

996
00:42:40,310 --> 00:42:41,229
Did Peng Cheng

997
00:42:41,470 --> 00:42:42,430
really turn on us again?

998
00:42:42,950 --> 00:42:44,269
He always said

999
00:42:44,589 --> 00:42:45,589
his pockets are empty.

1000
00:42:45,990 --> 00:42:47,192
How did he suddenly get rich?

1001
00:42:47,669 --> 00:42:48,510
Are you crazy?

1002
00:42:49,149 --> 00:42:49,870
Are you crazy?

1003
00:42:50,109 --> 00:42:50,950
What are you doing?

1004
00:42:51,510 --> 00:42:52,510
I told Lu Hui

1005
00:42:52,870 --> 00:42:54,030
that her dad's death

1006
00:42:54,069 --> 00:42:54,870
was on you.

1007
00:42:54,910 --> 00:42:55,990
I'll always be here,

1008
00:42:56,109 --> 00:42:57,149
watching you,

1009
00:42:57,390 --> 00:42:58,069
staying close.

1010
00:42:58,318 --> 00:42:59,470
You'll never get rid of me.

1011
00:42:59,470 --> 00:43:01,030
Your current wife, Lu Hui,

1012
00:43:01,269 --> 00:43:02,709
and your ex-wife, Yu Meng,

1013
00:43:02,950 --> 00:43:04,310
(Ping An Million Accident Insurance)
are teaming up against you.

1014
00:43:04,328 --> 00:43:06,526
(1. Policyholder Information,
Policyholder Name: Lu Hui)

1015
00:43:22,120 --> 00:43:26,989
♪Old dreams have faded in color♪

1016
00:43:29,473 --> 00:43:34,336
♪A lonely heart torn in conflict♪

1017
00:43:36,794 --> 00:43:41,639
♪The love that stumbled along♪

1018
00:43:42,084 --> 00:43:48,586
♪Was just a quiet release♪

1019
00:43:51,318 --> 00:43:58,271
♪I write the future into a song,
honoring the brave with no regrets♪

1020
00:43:58,821 --> 00:44:04,751
♪Turning all losses
into the passion of this moment♪

1021
00:44:05,875 --> 00:44:13,106
♪I write the future into a song,
for the me who never walks away♪

1022
00:44:13,409 --> 00:44:18,582
♪Forging all weaknesses
into sharp, bold colors♪

1023
00:44:19,202 --> 00:44:30,670
♪In this life,
I follow only my own choice♪

1024
00:44:33,170 --> 00:44:38,418
♪The chilled night has lost its color♪

1025
00:44:40,459 --> 00:44:45,894
♪No need to echo those
who drifted apart♪

1026
00:44:47,716 --> 00:44:53,113
♪No longer proving my worth to anyone♪

1027
00:44:53,113 --> 00:45:01,758
♪The answer has long been etched
in my silhouette♪

1028
00:45:02,234 --> 00:45:09,797
♪I write the future into a song,
for the me who never walks away♪

1029
00:45:09,797 --> 00:45:15,643
♪Paving every twist and turn
into a path forward♪

1030
00:45:15,643 --> 00:45:25,810
♪The ending of this life
will be set by me♪

